What's the result that you're looking for?

00:27:10.000 --> 00:27:11.720
Less fatalities. That's it.

00:27:13.640 --> 00:27:19.440
Yeah, I think less could be achievable and that is less in

00:27:19.440 --> 00:27:25.560
competition, less in general, all of the above.

