you can go fly by yourself anywhere.

00:29:50.440 --> 00:29:54.160
And so you try to create a culture in which, and I think

00:29:54.160 --> 00:29:58.480
we've done a pretty good job, in which we have training

00:29:58.480 --> 00:30:00.400
requirements. Climbing does not.

00:30:02.680 --> 00:30:04.920
Climbing has a pretty good mentor culture.

00:30:04.920 --> 00:30:10.320
We have a really good mentor culture and in climbing we have

00:30:10.360 --> 00:30:15.600
no expectation of 0 fatalities. And from what I hear from you,

00:30:16.000 --> 00:30:19.280
you don't have an expectation of 0 fatalities because I think

