you could buy was the R11 and from Ozone and the Boomerang 8

00:34:00.120 --> 00:34:03.680
from Gin. And at the time I was flying

00:34:03.800 --> 00:34:09.800
Gin, so I was flying the Boomerang 8 and it was mind

00:34:09.800 --> 00:34:12.520
bogglingly fast with the trimmers out.

00:34:12.880 --> 00:34:20.199
And so the glider like all gliders before had speed bar and

