had the nerve for it, it was mine bogglingly fast on the roar

00:34:50.760 --> 00:34:56.199
of the wind with tremors out and speed bar was deafening.

00:34:56.440 --> 00:34:59.160
If your radio was on full blast right next to your ear, you

