00:47:11.240 --> 00:47:18.400
glider, the cream rose to the top anyway, you know, and so the

00:47:18.400 --> 00:47:22.480
top pilots, even though we took away things that they were good

00:47:22.480 --> 00:47:27.960
at and leveled the playing field to the mortals advantage, they

00:47:27.960 --> 00:47:30.960
found a way to win anyway because they were talented.

00:47:31.080 --> 00:47:36.760
And so I, I went to the Super final in Columbia last year and

