that was the, I know, the first PwC style race with all the top

00:47:45.680 --> 00:47:50.200
European pilots that I've been to in over a decade.

00:47:51.440 --> 00:47:56.160
And I was amazed how the top pilots still found an advantage

00:47:56.480 --> 00:47:59.680
even though I was on exactly the same kit that they were on now.

00:47:59.800 --> 00:48:05.120
Submarine Enzo on most of the field was on, you know,

00:48:05.440 --> 00:48:10.080
submarines and Enzos or X ones and Genie race fives and, you

